♥️Save this: the most romantic and secluded hotels in Lapland

📍 Arctic TreeHouse Hotel (Rovaniemi) — designer cabins hidden in the forest with panoramic windows, soft lighting, and a strong sense of privacy. Perfect for quiet evenings for two.
@arctictreehousehotel

📍 Wilderness Hotel Muotka (Inari) — a remote lodge in the tundra with fireplaces, saunas, very few guests, and complete silence all around. A true "just us and the North" escape.
@wildernesshotels

📍 Wilderness Hotel Nellim (Lake Inari) — a cozy lakeside hotel with fireplaces, spa facilities, and an atmosphere of total disconnection from the outside world.
@wildernesshotels

📍 Apukka Resort (Rovaniemi) — glass igloos and private cabins where you can watch the starry sky straight from your bed, plus spa facilities and warm, inviting interiors.
@apukkaresort

📍 Arctic SnowHotel & Glass Igloos (Rovaniemi) — a unique romantic experience combining a snow hotel with glass igloos for unforgettable nights under the northern sky.
@arcticsnowhotel

📍 Arctic Light Hotel (Rovaniemi) — an intimate boutique hotel with a warm atmosphere, stylish rooms, and high-level service for a calm and elegant city stay.
@arctic_light_hotel
